~/psalms/98 {1 O sing unto the LORD a new song; for he hath done marvellous things: his right hand, and his holy arm, hath gotten him the victory. / 2 The LORD hath made known his salvation: his righteousness hath he openly shewed in the sight of the heathen. / 3 He hath remembered his mercy and his truth toward the house of Israel: all the ends of the earth have seen the salvation of our God. / 4 Make a joyful noise unto the LORD, all the earth: make a loud noise, and rejoice, and sing praise. / 5 Sing unto the LORD with the harp; with the harp, and the voice of a psalm. / ... [9 verses total]}

